# KnowledgeOS - Database Design

# Part 6 - CHat Sessions Table

---

# 20. Table — Chat Sessions

---

# 20.1 Purpose

The `chat_sessions` table represents a single conversation between a user and the KnowledgeOS AI assistant.

A chat session acts as the parent container for all messages exchanged during a conversation. It maintains conversation metadata, user preferences, retrieval settings, and conversation state while individual user and assistant messages are stored separately in the `chat_messages` table.

The separation of sessions and messages provides:

- Better scalability
- Faster chat history loading
- Cleaner conversation management
- Improved analytics
- Support for future conversation branching
- Easier synchronization with AI memory systems

Each chat session belongs exclusively to one authenticated user.

---

# 20.2 Relationships

```text
profiles

│

└──────────── chat_sessions

                    │

                    │ 1 : N

                    ▼

              chat_messages
```

A user may own multiple chat sessions.

Each chat session contains multiple messages.

A message cannot exist without a parent session.

---

# 20.3 Session Lifecycle

```text
New Chat

↓

Chat Session Created

↓

Messages Added

↓

Conversation Memory Updated

↓

Conversation Archived

↓

(Optional)

Conversation Deleted
```

A session remains active until the user deletes it.

Deleting a session permanently removes all associated messages.

---

# 20.4 Table Schema

| Column | Data Type | Nullable | Default | Description |
|---------|-----------|----------|----------|-------------|
| id | UUID | No | gen_random_uuid() | Primary Key |
| profile_id | UUID | No | — | Owner of the conversation |
| title | VARCHAR(255) | No | 'New Chat' | Conversation title |
| summary | TEXT | Yes | NULL | AI-generated conversation summary |
| total_messages | INTEGER | No | 0 | Cached message count |
| last_message_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Yes | NULL | Timestamp of latest message |
| last_accessed_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Yes | NULL | Last opened by user |
| retrieval_enabled | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Enable RAG retrieval |
| planner_enabled | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Enable Planner Agent |
| reviewer_enabled | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Enable Reviewer Agent |
| streaming_enabled | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Enable token streaming |
| is_pinned | BOOLEAN | No | FALSE | Pin conversation |
| is_archived | BOOLEAN | No | FALSE | Archive conversation |
| is_deleted | BOOLEAN | No | FALSE | Soft delete |
| deleted_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Yes | NULL | Soft delete timestamp |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | No | NOW() | Creation timestamp |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | No | NOW() | Last modification |

