# 20.5 Constraints

## Primary Key

```sql
PRIMARY KEY (id);
```

---

## Foreign Key

```sql
FOREIGN KEY (profile_id)

REFERENCES profiles(id)

ON DELETE CASCADE;
```

Deleting a user automatically removes all conversations.

---

## Check Constraints

```sql
CHECK(total_messages >= 0);
```

---

```sql
CHECK(title <> '');
```

Conversation titles cannot be empty.

